{"id":"105156","t":{"th":"ผู้กล้าสุดแกร่ง ขี้ระแวงขั้นวิกฤติ","ro":"Shinchou Yuusha: Kono Yuusha ga Ore TUEEE Kuse ni Shinchou Sugiru","en":"Cautious Hero: The Hero Is Overpowered but Overly Cautious","na":"慎重勇者～この勇者が俺ＴＵＥＥＥくせに慎重すぎる～"},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx105156-ZVtxISdoUqnY.png","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx105156-ZVtxISdoUqnY.png","color":"#e4ae5d","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/105156-AER446HoeuJZ.jpg","fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":12,"dur":24,"season":"FALL","year":2019,"start":"2019-10-02","country":"JP","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"score":73,"pop":205691,"studio":"WHITE FOX","desc":"There is a popular saying: \"you can never be too careful.\" It is very important to prepare for every situation you may face, even if it seems like an unnecessary waste of time. Also, in games like RPGs, it is good to exceed the level of your enemies to achieve total victory.\n\nThese words describe Seiya Ryuuguuin a little too perfectly. After being summoned by the goddess Ristarte to save the world of Gaeabrande from destruction, the hero prepares himself for his noble journey. While this might be normal, he spends a very long time training himself, despite having overpowered stats. He fights weak enemies using his strongest skills and buys excessive amounts of supplies and potions—all to stay safe.\n\nWhile his attitude may be a bit annoying, it might just be the saving grace of Gaeabrande, especially considering that it is a world where the forces of evil dominate each and every expectation.","descTh":"เทพธิดา Rista เรียกฮีโร่มาช่วยโลกที่คล้ายกับวิดีโอเกมโหมดยากของเธอ เซย์ย่า ฮีโร่มีความโดดเด่นในทุกด้าน แต่เขาระมัดระวังอย่างมากในการซื้อชุดเกราะสามชุด (ชุดหนึ่งสำหรับใส่ ชุดสำรอง และชุดสำรอง) และทุ่มพลังเต็มที่เพื่อต่อสู้กับสไลม์ที่อ่อนแอ (เผื่อไว้)","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":"licensor","descTh":"gtranslate"},"trai